# Capture output from scripts/capture-ship.mjs
/shots

# Commit message scratch. Narrative commit bodies are written here and passed
# with `git commit -F`, so the command string stays short — a heredoc puts
# newlines in the command itself, which no permission pattern matches.
/.cmsg.txt

# Render masters. The 4K PNG and the EXR are ~70 MB of sources, not deliverables —
# what ships is the web-sized AVIF/WebP in public/images/bridge, encoded from them.
# Binaries that large are painful to remove from history once committed, and the
# .blend scenes they came from live outside the repo in vertex-assets/ anyway.
# The render log beside them is text and stays tracked.
/renders/*
!/renders/*.md

